BEGIN;
-- ภาพยนตร์ skill from a theatrical wuxia trailer (65 cuts in 124 s, median shot 1.4 s): three acts
-- plus a button, multi-shot clips with cuts of 1.5-3 s, one move per cut in fights, short lines in
